B.ZV=s(["K\u0131\u015f mevsiminde veya Zud uyar\u0131s\u0131 geldi\u011finde donan binan\u0131za dokunun.",'Alt men\xfcde k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 yanan "B\u0130NAYI ISIT" butonuna bas\u0131n.',"Odun veya ke\xe7e harcayarak binan\u0131n donmas\u0131n\u0131 engelleyin."],t.s)
B.a0_=s(["During winter/Zud alert, tap on any frozen building.","Tap the glowing HEAT BUILDING action button in the sheet.","Spend wood/felt to keep the building warm and operational."],t.s)
B.a__=s(["Sonbahar aylar\u0131nda odun harcamay\u0131 k\u0131s\u0131p k\u0131\u015f i\xe7in en az 200 odun stoku yap\u0131n."],t.s)
