B.SQ=new A.bw("seasons_zud_mechanic",B.pM,"4 Mevsim D\xf6ng\xfcs\xfc, K\u0131\u015f & Zud Afeti","4 Seasons, Winter & Severe Zud Frost","Bahar\u0131n ekiminden yaz\u0131n hasad\u0131na; k\u0131\u015f\u0131n dondurucu zud ayaz\u0131nda binalar\u0131 \u0131s\u0131tma takti\u011fi.","From spring planting to summer harvests, protect buildings with heat during harsh winter Zud.",'Her mevsim 60 saniye s\xfcrer (1 Y\u0131l = 4 Mevsim = 240sn):\n\n\u2022 Bahar: Ekim mevsimi; tarla maliyetleri d\xfc\u015fer, fidanlar co\u015far.\n\u2022 Yaz: Hasat zirvesi; t\xfcm tar\u0131m ve bal\u0131k\xe7\u0131l\u0131k +%50 daha h\u0131zl\u0131 \xfcretir.\n\u2022 Sonbahar: Stok ve pazar bereketi; ticaret gelirleri artar.\n\u2022 K\u0131\u015f & Zud Afeti: Dondurucu ayaz ba\u015flar. Zud vurdu\u011funda \u0131s\u0131t\u0131lmayan binalar donar (%0 verim). Karoya dokunup "ISIT" butonuna basarak Odun ve Ke\xe7e ile binay\u0131 donmaktan koruyabilirsiniz.',"Seasons cycle every 60s. Winter brings severe Zud frost where unheated buildings freeze (0% yield). Heat them using Wood and Felt to sustain output.",B.pP,B.fz,"\u0130KL\u0130M & ZUD",B.a4n,B.ZV,B.a0_,B.a__,B.a_1,B.a0a)
