B.Tk=new A.bw("bld_mine",B.av,"Demir Madeni (Cevher Oca\u011f\u0131)","Iron Mine (Ore Smelting)","Da\u011f derinliklerinden demir filizi \xe7\u0131kar\u0131r. Silah, z\u0131rh ve \u015eam \xc7eli\u011fi i\xe7in temel kaynakt\u0131r.","Excavates raw iron ore from mountains. Crucial for arms and Damascus Steel.","Demir Madeni, zengin Da\u011f arazilerine kurulur. Saniyede 0.30 Demir cevheri \xe7\u0131kar\u0131r. Demir, askeri doktrinler, \u015eam Oca\u011f\u0131 ve Ka\u011fan Ota\u011f\u0131n\u0131n y\xfcksek seviyeleri i\xe7in stratejik bir madendir.","Mines 0.30 Iron/sec on Mountain tiles. Required for Damascus Forges and military doctrines.",B.Uj,B.I,"SV.15 | DA\u011e",B.a3W,B.J,B.J,B.a19,B.a29,B.a07)
