B.a0U=s(["A\xe7\u0131kta duran ancak hen\xfcz fethedilmemi\u015f bir kom\u015fu karoya dokunun.","Gerekli G\u0131da miktar\u0131n\u0131 alt panelden teyit edin.","TOPRA\u011eI FETHET butonuna basarak karoyu ka\u011fanl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131za kat\u0131n."],t.s)
B.a1m=s(["Tap an adjacent discovered tile in the fog boundary.","Verify required Food amount in the bottom action bar.","Tap CONQUER LAND to claim the territory."],t.s)
B.a_4=s(["\xd6ncelikle su kenarlar\u0131 ve zengin orman karolar\u0131n\u0131 fethederek erken hammadde sa\u011flay\u0131n.",'T\xf6re Meclisinde "Bozk\u0131r Ak\u0131nc\u0131s\u0131" doktrinini takarak fetih maliyetinde %20 indirim kazan\u0131n.',"Fetih maliyeti 20.000 g\u0131day\u0131 a\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131nda haritada oyalanmay\u0131n; B\xfcy\xfck G\xf6\xe7 ile Kut \xe7arpan\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 katlay\u0131n."],t.s)
B.a1h=s(["Conquer forest and water edges first for strong early resource yields.","Equip Steppe Raider doctrine in the Tore Council to discount conquest cost by 20%.","When conquest cost exceeds 20,000 food, initiate a Great Migration instead of grinding."],t.s)
